<title>Leagues</title>
<description>Legacy core-concepts page for weekly and monthly competition.</description>
<content>Leagues turn campaign activity into recurring competition. Weekly epochs run Monday 00:00 UTC to the next Monday 00:00 UTC. Monthly epochs run from the 1st day of the month at 00:00 UTC to the 1st day of the next month at 00:00 UTC. League prize pools are funded by 0.75% of every buy and sell routed to LeagueTreasury. Read the current page: **[Leagues](/leagues)**.</content>
