<loc>https://docs.memewar.zone/roadmap</loc>
<title>Roadmap</title>
<description>The high-level MemeWarzone rollout direction.</description>
<content>MemeWarzone is rolling out as a competitive on-chain ecosystem. The roadmap focuses on campaign activation, routing, rewards, transparency, and long-term user progression. ## Prepare Mode Prepare Mode opens the door for: - creator campaign preparation - recruiter onboarding - squad building - early user education - docs and safety guidance ## Live campaign system The live system brings: - campaign deployment - bonding-curve trading - UpVotes - 50 BNB graduation threshold - 2.00% finalize fee - 80/20 post-finalize split ## Routing and rewards Core incentive systems include: - TreasuryRouter fee routing - LeagueTreasury funding - RecruiterRewardsVault - CommunityRewardsVault - Squad Pool - Warzone BNB Airdrops - weekly epochs and claims ## Trust and transparency Trust work includes: - public leaderboards - public winner pages - private reward dashboards - anti-abuse reason codes - no dev-wallet protocol revenue custody - multisig treasury policy ## Long-term direction Future iterations can expand: - creator reputation - richer profile pages - League categories - squad analytics - recruiter tooling - reward transparency - campaign safety signals</content>
